            <div class="zn-element zn-lg  ">
              <h3 id="" class="zn-heading "   ><p>“On evenings and weekends, the people who lived the bootlegging way of life would get together and play and pass a little something spirited around.”&nbsp;</p><p>— Anna Prillaman on the tie between playing music and drinking spirits</p></h3>
